    "text": "If the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then which of the following statements is TRUE?"
  },
  "options": [
